    <h1>Agricultural Disclaimer</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--ink-soft);">Last updated: October 2026</p>
    <h2>General Information</h2>
    <p>GoOrganicAfrica publishes agricultural education, research summaries, practical farming guides and planning tools. The information is general in nature and may not account for every farm, climate, soil type, production system, market or regulatory environment.</p>
    <h2>Profit and Cost Estimates</h2>
    <p>Figures produced by the Farm Profit Calculator are estimates, not promises of income. Reference prices, yields and costs can change. Always confirm important assumptions with current local suppliers, buyers, extension professionals and other appropriate sources.</p>
    <h2>Crop and Livestock Advice</h2>
    <p>Production recommendations should be adapted to local conditions. Disease, pest, animal-health, pesticide, veterinary, food-safety and regulatory decisions may require qualified local professional advice.</p>
    <h2>Market and Financial Decisions</h2>
    <p>Nothing on this website constitutes investment, financial, lending, insurance, legal or tax advice. Do your own due diligence before borrowing, purchasing inputs, entering contracts or committing capital.</p>
    <h2>External Sources</h2>
    <p>Where we reference external organisations or sources, readers should verify current information directly with the relevant organisation. External links can change or become unavailable.</p>
    <h2>Your Responsibility</h2>
    <p>You remain responsible for decisions made on your farm and for complying with applicable laws, regulations, safety requirements and professional guidance.</p>
